cpp.solutions:
## solutions

#### iterative

```cpp
#include <string>

std::string getNodeValue(Node* head, int idx) {
  Node* current = head;
  int count = 0;
  while (current != nullptr) {
    if (count == idx) {
      return current->val;
    }
    current = current->next;
    count += 1;
  }
  return "";
}
```

- n = number of nodes
- Time: O(n)
- Space: O(1)

#### recursive

```cpp
#include <string>

std::string getNodeValue(Node* head, int idx) {
  if (head == nullptr) {
    return "";
  }

  if (idx == 0) {
    return head->val;
  }

  return getNodeValue(head->next, idx - 1);
}
```

- n = number of nodes
- Time: O(n)
- Space: O(n)
